3a1fdbfb57b4"],

Cell["\<\
Parameter space where simulations are numerically-stable (chaotic dynamics \
emerge in the unstable feasible region of the BioticCRM), but the \
self-consistency equations are poorly solved.
(The saving protocol for the biotic model is slightly different/more regular \
than the abiotic model because Mathematica often crashes in the chaotic \
region.)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.985080980949251*^9, 3.9850810894010353`*^9}, {
  3.9850814209127884`*^9, 
  3.9850814873655014`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"b4be835e-753f-8643-abd5-\
aa2ff61489b8"],

